==Sanskrit==

===Alternative scripts===
{{sa-alt}}

===Etymology===
{{root|sa|ine-pro|*h₂erǵ-}}
{{dercat|sa|inc-pro|iir-pro}}
{{ety|sa|id=silver|:inh|ine-pro:*h₂r̥ǵn̥tóm<id:silver>|tree=1}}
Perhaps from {{der|sa|ine-pro|*h₂ŕ̥ǵn̥tom|t=silver}}. However, this Sanskrit word may actually point to a pre-form of the shape {{m|ine-pro||*h₂reǵn̥t-ó-m}}, with a full-grade in the root, unlike the other Indo-European cognates (i.e. {{cog|ae|𐬆𐬭𐬆𐬰𐬀𐬙𐬀|t=silver}}, {{cog|la|argentum|t=silver}}). Within Sanskrit itself, the term {{m|sa|अर्जुन|tr=árjuna|t=white, bright}} reflects a slightly different full grade of the shape {{m|ine-pro|*h₂erǵ-}}. Given the discrepancies between this term and the reconstructable PIE pre-form, it has been suggested that it is a secondary formation, perhaps based on original {{m|sa||*ऋजत|tr=*ṛjatá-}}.<ref>{{R:ine:Thorsø:2023|page=8}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
{{sa-IPA|a=3}}

===Adjective===
{{sa-adj|tr=rajatá}}

# [[white]], [[bright]] white, [[silver]]-[[coloured]] {{q|also applied to {{m|sa|हिरण्य}} to denote silver the metal, literally meaning "white gold"}}
#* {{Q|sa||RV|8|25|22|quote=ऋज्रमुक्षण्यायने '''रजतं''' हरयाणे ।<br>रथं युक्तमसनाम सुषामणि ॥|trans=From Uksanyayana a bay, from Harayana a '''silvery white''' steed,<br>And from Susaman we obtained a hamessed car.}}
#* {{Q|sa||TS|I|5|1|quote=यद् अश्र्व् अशीयत तत्<br>'''रजतꣳ''' हिरण्यम् अभवत् तस्माद् '''रजतꣳ''' हिरण्यम् अदक्षिण्यम् अश्रुजꣳ हि|trans=The tear that was shed (while crying) became '''white''' gold (silver); therefore '''white''' gold (silver) is not a suitable gift, for it is born of tears}}
# [[silvery]], made of [[silver]]

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-adj-mfn|rajatá|rajatā́|rajatá}}

===Noun===
{{sa-noun|n|tr=rajatá}}

# [[silver]]
#: {{syn|sa|रूप्य}}
#* {{Q|sa||AV|5|28|1|quote=नव प्राणान् नवभिः सं मिमीते दीर्घायुत्वाय शतशारदाय ।<br>हरिते त्रीणि '''रजते''' त्रीण्ययसि त्रीणि तपसाविष्टितानि ॥|trans=For lengthened life, to last through hundred autumns, they equalize with nine the nine aspirations.<br>Three in gold, three '''in silver''', three in iron by heat are stablished in their several places.}}
# [[ivory]]

